San Andreas is a 2015 American disaster thriller film starring Dwayne Johnson.

11
01:02:42,000 --> 01:02:48,000
The film was directed by Brad Peyton and written by Carlton Cuse.

12
01:08:24,000 --> 01:08:30,000
Carla Gugino, Alexandra Daddario, Ioan Gruffudd, Archie
Panjabi and Paul Giamatti also star.

13
01:14:06,000 --> 01:14:12,000
Its plot centers on a massive earthquake caused by the San Andreas
Fault that devastates the West Coast of the United States.

14
01:19:48,000 --> 01:19:54,000
Principal photography of the film started on April 22, 2014, in
Queensland, Australia, and wrapped up on July 28 in San Francisco.

15
01:25:30,000 --> 01:25:36,000
The film premiered in Hollywood, Los Angeles, on May 26, 2015,
and was released in the United States on May 29.

16
01:31:12,000 --> 01:31:18,000
It received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the visual effects and Johnson
and Gugino's performances but criticized the plot and characters.

17
01:36:54,000 --> 01:37:00,000
The film grossed $475 million worldwide on a $110 million budget.

